{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17982","headline":"鸣雁 · 韩愈","name":"鸣雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗷嗷鸣雁鸣且飞，穷秋南去春北归。\n去寒就暖识所依，天长地阔栖息稀。\n风霜酸苦稻粱微，毛羽摧落身不肥。\n裴回反顾羣侣违，哀鸣欲下洲渚非。\n江南水阔朝云多，草长沙软无网罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}